{"articleNo":"981","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=981&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 제21기 최고경영관리자과정 모집안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.17","hit":"9676","attachments":[{"name":"2010학년도 제21기 최경과정 모집안내2.PDF","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=981&attachNo=71126"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font size=\"3\">2010학년도 산업대학원 제21기 최고경영관리자과정 신입생 모집일정을 다음과 같이 안내합니다.</font></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 다&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 음 -</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">1. 모집인원 : 55명 내외</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">2. 지원자격&nbsp; * 공공기관, 단체의 장 또는 임원<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 정부 각 기관의 중견 공무원<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 공·사 기업체의 중견 관리자 또는 임원<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 위 각 항과 동등 이상 또는 유사한 지도급 인사</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">3. 교육기간 : 2010. 3. 2 ~ 2011. 2. 28</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">4. 전형방법 : 서류전형 및 면접</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">5. 지원절차<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;가) 원서교부 : 2009. 11. 11 ~ 12. 17<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;나) 원서접수 : 2009. 12. 14(월) ~ 12. 17(목) 18:00 까지<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;다) 교부 및 접수장소 : 최고경영관리자과정팀(글로벌관 445호)<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;라) 지원서류<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; ① 입학지원서(소정서식) 1통<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 사업자등록증 사본(또는 재직증명서) 1통<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;③ 주민등록등본 1통<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ④ 사진(4*5, 최근 3개월 이내) 3매<br></strong></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;마) 전형료 : 50,000원<br></strong></font></span><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;바) 면 접 일 시 : 2009. 12. 22(화) 14:00<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;사) 합격자발표 : 2009. 12. 31(목) 14:00</font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">6. 기타 자세한 사항은 첨부파일을 참고하시고, 의문사항이 있으시면<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>최고경영관리자과정팀(☎478-7037)</strong>로 문의 바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
